{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"66dba1fc15edeaac","name":"card_unit_yamagata_regiment","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Japan/Breakthrough/units/card_unit_yamagata_regiment","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"YAMAGATA REGIMENT","text":"Has Ambush, Blitz and Fury if you have no cards in hand.","flavorText":"The 32nd Yamagata Infantry Regiment was attached to the 24th Division of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division was formed in Manchukuo in 1939 and was part of the Manchukuo territorial defense force under the command of the 5th Army group of the Kwantung Army. In 1944 companies from each of the division's regiments were sent to Woleai island in the Pacific. Most of the troops defending the Woleai island died from either starvation, disease or Allied air raids. The remainder of the 24th was sent to Okinawa to defend against an Allied invasion where the division was nearly annihilated during the  Battle of Okinawa in June 1945. Only the 1st and 3rd battalions of the 32nd Yamagata Infantry Regiment continued to fight the US occupation until they surrendered in late August that same year.","faction":"Japan","type":"infantry","rarity":"Uncommon","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":2,"defense":3},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_unit_yamagata_regiment","title":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_yamagata_regiment_title","SourceString":"YAMAGATA REGIMENT","LocalizedString":"YAMAGATA REGIMENT"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::infantry","attack":2,"defense":3,"range":1,"faction":"EFactionEnum::Japan","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_yamagata_regiment_text","SourceString":"Has Ambush, Blitz and Fury if you have no cards in hand.","LocalizedString":"Has Ambush, Blitz and Fury if you have no cards in hand."},"flavorText":{"Namespace":"card_japan","Key":"card_unit_yamagata_regiment_history","SourceString":"The 32nd Yamagata Infantry Regiment was attached to the 24th Division of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division was formed in Manchukuo in 1939 and was part of the Manchukuo territorial defense force under the command of the 5th Army group of the Kwantung Army. In 1944 companies from each of the division's regiments were sent to Woleai island in the Pacific. Most of the troops defending the Woleai island died from either starvation, disease or Allied air raids. The remainder of the 24th was sent to Okinawa to defend against an Allied invasion where the division was nearly annihilated during the  Battle of Okinawa in June 1945. Only the 1st and 3rd battalions of the 32nd Yamagata Infantry Regiment continued to fight the US occupation until they surrendered in late August that same year.","LocalizedString":"The 32nd Yamagata Infantry Regiment was attached to the 24th Division of the Imperial Japanese Army. The division was formed in Manchukuo in 1939 and was part of the Manchukuo territorial defense force under the command of the 5th Army group of the Kwantung Army. In 1944 companies from each of the division's regiments were sent to Woleai island in the Pacific. Most of the troops defending the Woleai island died from either starvation, disease or Allied air raids. The remainder of the 24th was sent to Okinawa to defend against an Allied invasion where the division was nearly annihilated during the  Battle of Okinawa in June 1945. Only the 1st and 3rd battalions of the 32nd Yamagata Infantry Regiment continued to fight the US occupation until they surrendered in late August that same year."},"rarity":"ERarityEnum::Uncommon","cardSet":"ECardSetEnum::Breakthrough","isReserved":true,"EffectType":"ECardEffectTypes::Passive","usedTriggers":["ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDiscarded","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCovertCardPlayedFromHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardReset","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardSpawnedInHand","ERegisteredCardFunction::OnOtherCardDrawnFromDeck"],"extraHelpTextBubbleTypes"